  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Page Content About Us",
      "category": "Bytefied",
      "settings": {
        "style_variant": "editorial",
        "eyebrow": "About us",
        "title": "Real fragrance, fair prices, and no guessing",
        "lead": "<p>We started Sams Fragrance Shop for one simple reason. Great perfume should not feel out of reach, and you should never have to wonder if the bottle in your hands is the real thing.</p>",
        "head_image_ratio": "21-9",
        "head_image_caption": "The shelf we build every order from"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Walk into a department store and a bottle you love can easily cost more than your weekly groceries. That always felt wrong to us. So we set out to build a shop where you can find the <strong>designer and niche fragrances</strong> people actually talk about, from houses like Creed, Parfums de Marly, Maison Francis Kurkdjian, Initio, Tom Ford and Xerjoff, at prices that make sense.</p><p>We buy at wholesale and keep our margins honest. There are no fancy counters, no celebrity campaigns and no markups hiding behind a pretty box. What you save goes straight back into your collection.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "stats",
          "settings": {
            "value_1": "4.8",
            "label_1": "Average rating from our customers",
            "value_2": "2 days",
            "label_2": "Most orders leave within two business days",
            "value_3": "$125",
            "label_3": "Free shipping once you reach it"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "media_text",
          "settings": {
            "image_position": "left",
            "heading": "A small shop, not a warehouse",
            "text": "<p>We pack every order by hand from one shelf, which is why nothing goes out that we have not looked at ourselves. It is slower than a warehouse, and that is the point.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Try it before you commit",
            "subheading": "The part of our shop people love the most"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Buying a full bottle based on a paper strip or a video review is a gamble. A scent changes on your skin through the day, and what smells amazing in the first minute can turn into something you never want to wear again by the afternoon.</p><p>That is why we offer <strong>samples starting at $6.99</strong>. Each one is filled straight from a genuine bottle, so what you test is exactly what you would buy. Wear it to work, wear it on a night out, see what people say. When one feels like it was made for you, come back for the full bottle with total confidence.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "points",
          "settings": {
            "title_1": "Full bottles and samples",
            "text_1": "Shop the full size of your favourites or explore a few new ones in sample size first.",
            "title_2": "Designer and niche in one place",
            "text_2": "From everyday crowd pleasers to rare niche releases, all under one roof.",
            "title_3": "Packed with care",
            "text_3": "Every order is wrapped securely so it arrives looking exactly like it left us.",
            "title_4": "Real people behind the shop",
            "text_4": "Questions about a scent or an order get answered by someone who actually knows perfume."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our goal is simple. Help you find the scent people remember you by, without overpaying and without the guesswork.</p>",
            "byline": "The Sams Fragrance Shop team",
            "style": "dark"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Hundreds of customers have already left us reviews, and we read every single one. People tell us about fast delivery, careful packaging and the little extra samples we like to slip into orders. We would rather earn your trust one order at a time than ask for it upfront.</p><p>Thank you for being here. We cannot wait to help you find your next signature scent.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "buttons",
          "settings": {
            "label_1": "Shop Samples",
            "label_2": "Read Reviews"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Page Content Authenticity",
      "category": "Bytefied",
      "settings": {
        "style_variant": "verified",
        "color_scheme": "white",
        "eyebrow": "Verified authentic",
        "title": "Every bottle is the real thing",
        "lead": "<p>For us authenticity is not a marketing line. It is the one rule we never bend, on every order, every sample and every bottle that leaves our shop.</p>",
        "head_image_ratio": "3-2",
        "head_image_caption": "Batch codes checked against the brand before anything ships"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The fragrance world has a real problem with fakes. Some look almost perfect on the outside, but the scent fades in an hour and can even irritate your skin. We know how frustrating it is to spend good money and end up with a copy, which is exactly why we are so strict about where our stock comes from.</p><p>Everything we sell is sourced from <strong>established, verified distributors</strong> in the fragrance industry. We do not buy from random resellers, we do not chase suspiciously cheap deals and we never cut corners to hit a lower price.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How we keep it genuine",
            "subheading": "What happens before a bottle ever reaches you"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "points",
          "settings": {
            "title_1": "Trusted sources only",
            "text_1": "Our stock comes from reputable distributors we have worked with and checked over time.",
            "title_2": "Batch codes checked",
            "text_2": "We verify batch codes so the bottle matches what the brand actually produced.",
            "title_3": "Samples from real bottles",
            "text_3": "Every sample is filled from a genuine bottle, so testing is never a compromise.",
            "title_4": "Inspected before shipping",
            "text_4": "Each order is looked over and packed by hand before it goes out the door."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "ratio": "16-9",
            "caption": "A batch code on the base of the bottle, checked against the brand's own records."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>If it is on our shelves, it is authentic. That is our promise, and we stand behind it on every single order.</p>",
            "byline": "Sams Fragrance Shop",
            "style": "dark"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why our prices are lower"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>A lower price can make people nervous, and that is fair. The answer is simple. We buy at wholesale and run a lean shop online, so we skip the rent, staff and advertising costs that push retail prices up. The juice inside the bottle is the same one you would find at a luxury counter. You are just not paying for the counter.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Still unsure? Do not just take our word for it. Hundreds of real customers have shared their experience, and many of them mention checking their bottles themselves. Have a look at what they have to say, and if you ever have a question about a specific product, reach out and we will happily walk you through it.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "buttons",
          "settings": {
            "label_1": "Read Reviews",
            "label_2": "Contact Us"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
